---
title: How to Filter Services?
sidebar:
  order: 4
---
**Easily find the services you need by using Taskip’s filtering options. You can filter services by status or type:**

### **Filter By Status**

1. **Go to the Taskip main menu and select Services.**
1. **On the right, click the Filter dropdown.**
1. **Choose the desired status: All Status, Published, or Unpublished.**
1. **Services matching that status will appear.**

### **Filter By Type**

1. **Go to the Taskip main menu and select Services.**
1. **On the right, click the Filter dropdown.**
1. **Choose the desired type: All Types, One-time, or Subscription.**
1. **Services of that type will be displayed.**
